1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site-main page-guide-settings","id":"main","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"page-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"mycmux ガイド"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"アカウントと設定"}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"guide-nav","aria-label":"使い方の中の移動","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"guide-nav-root","href":"/guide","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"使い方"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","/guide/screen",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/guide/screen","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"画面と操作"}]}],["$","li","/guide/agents",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/guide/agents","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エージェントとの作業"}]}],["$","li","/guide/settings",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/guide/settings","aria-current":"page","children":"アカウントと設定"}]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"intro","children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>アカウントと使用量、コストの内訳、見た目とキー、AI と自動化、リモート接続とキャラクターの設定です。末尾に、よく使うキーと用語の一覧を置きました。操作の基本は<a href=\"/guide/screen\">画面と操作</a>に、委譲や保存は<a href=\"/guide/agents\">エージェントとの作業</a>にあります。</p>"}}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-layout","children":[["$","$Le",null,{"sections":[{"id":"usage","title":"アカウントと使用量を確かめたい"},{"id":"logs","title":"何にコストがかかったかを見たい"},{"id":"appearance","title":"見た目やキーを変えたい"},{"id":"automation","title":"AI と自動化を止めたい"},{"id":"remote","title":"リモートやキャラクターを使いたい"},{"id":"shortcuts","title":"よく使うキー"},{"id":"glossary","title":"用語"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-article","children":[["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"このページの目次"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"このページの目次","children":["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","usage",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#usage","children":"アカウントと使用量を確かめたい"}]}],["$","li","logs",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#logs","children":"何にコストがかかったかを見たい"}]}],["$","li","appearance",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#appearance","children":"見た目やキーを変えたい"}]}],["$","li","automation",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#automation","children":"AI と自動化を止めたい"}]}],["$","li","remote",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#remote","children":"リモートやキャラクターを使いたい"}]}],["$","li","shortcuts",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#shortcuts","children":"よく使うキー"}]}],["$","li","glossary",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#glossary","children":"用語"}]}]]}]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","section","usage",{"id":"usage","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"アカウントと使用量を確かめたい"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>タイトルバーの「アカウントと使用量」で、使用中のアカウントと取得できた使用率を見ます。詳しくは「設定 → アカウント・使用量 → アカウント別の使用量」へ進みます。取得時刻も一緒に確かめます。</p><p>行をクリックすると、<strong>PC 全体の CLI ログイン</strong>が切り替わります。mycmux 内で動いているセッションがあれば確認が出ますが、アプリの外の CLI は検知できません。Codex はアカウントごとの使用量を取れないため、空いている枠の比較には使えません。</p><p>追加は「+ アカウントを追加」から行います。現在のログインを壊さない隔離ログインで登録します。</p>"}}],["$","figure","1",{"className":"fig","data-fig":"F8","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-wide","viewBox":"0 0 720 230","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"タイトルバーの使用量メーターからアカウント一覧を開き、行をクリックして CLI ログインを切り替える流れ","data-vw":720,"data-fs":15,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":[["$","title",null,{"children":"タイトルバーの使用量メーターからアカウント一覧を開き、行をクリックして CLI ログインを切り替える流れ"}],["$","defs",null,{"children":[["$","marker",null,{"id":"F8-wide-arrow","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead"}]}],["$","marker",null,{"id":"F8-wide-arrow-accent","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead accent"}]}]]}],[["$","g","0",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M220 55L260 55","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F8-wide-arrow)"}],["$","g",null,{"className":"edge-label-group","children"